#. default-sha256: b359e4978f736311795d949477973f86f49b9d4cc28dcc1cc3e5fc8bf73370f2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It was the spring of my "
"fourteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫Era a primavera do meu décimo "
"quarto ano."

#: scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c53b89fd31e3c8f4e5fb670ab3313dfdf1a4790ce5820186bb87b32da0d202f
#. default-sha256: 0e0bc31710297945c34a15364d48c4ae27ae790ec4e02f05182811dbbce5d8e2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, for one, preferred it when the sun ⟪k:1⟫wasn’t⟪k:2⟫ out.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Not that sunlight would "
"kill me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu, por exemplo, preferia quando o sol ⟪k:1⟫não saía⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Não que a luz do sol "
"fosse me matar,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37e2c8d2525db77781d0fb5007dbb849838181f6b6dcbd6543e3ecf636a55623
#. default-sha256: ee1c778992e53cb77c972a219d4e4efc4b4637ca208169ec18557648060234eb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but if it was bright enough, the whole world was so white I could hardly see a thing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mas se fosse claro o suficiente, o mundo inteiro ficava tão branco que eu mal conseguia ver "
"alguma coisa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43630fbb0ca9be0c736525e205c576f3a3df805668767b8816c0b51d6bd8d055
