msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vamos, Michelle. Não me diga que você esqueceu o que fazer."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0ABF3D8_62DB_4464_816B_9A78E4EBECBA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 576ba09459baa66c68fc455cf203e6a682009311688e6ad023bbd83fbfb5e751
#. default-sha256: 74154a79f54a7ce68c64e49f51951aab4393795dd0a139d630a4b7e1d2f6e361
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0ABF3D8_62DB_4464_816B_9A78E4EBECBA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was to present my hand to the man—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫for him to kiss."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu deveria apresentar minha mão ao homem—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫para ele beijar."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2327DAAB_30A8_4D32_B4F8_3E0DC5D41020
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 251fbeec1c1f534f18f92b457cbb43d07a398e7259f5cf148ca1cc159ce1df95
#. default-sha256: 934eb2b2d34555f195dbe821d783b29c073000d8bee81cf13ef66874e51b5c2c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2327DAAB_30A8_4D32_B4F8_3E0DC5D41020"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why? Why was ⟪k:1⟫this⟪k:2⟫ a traditional greeting?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why did I have to go through "
"this?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por que? Por que ⟪k:1⟫isto⟪k:2⟫ era uma saudação tradicional?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Por que eu tinha que "
"passar por isso?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7172897A_D912_4EF8_80D5_B5C5A76497D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d1a82a18d3de0268013ba12216f0a742b45e6546e2456da38634ca29f30c3b2
#. default-sha256: 9302759c77a9f89b178a879e64b0265491a6c78936d34d080cceeb2b5f71f040
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7172897A_D912_4EF8_80D5_B5C5A76497D8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man kneeling before me gave an uncomfortable chuckle at my reluctance, shrugged, and "
"reverently took my hand in his."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O homem ajoelhado diante de mim deu uma risada desconfortável com a minha relutância, "
"encolheu os ombros e respeitosamente pegou minha mão nas suas."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA0A6502_E193_4DF5_B658_A0DFF2517305
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f677e697df7ac9c1edeaa05a44917bc7a1d98edcc3f4202111367c82b4c4920
#. default-sha256: 4b93da189f702ca2a0e7357d4c37ca0b048faeb724f000070f252be2d80516a6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EA0A6502_E193_4DF5_B658_A0DFF2517305"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Reflexively, I smacked the man’s hand away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Georges’s eyes went wide in horror, and "
"the man gave another playful shrug."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por reflexo, eu bati na mão do homem.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Os olhos de Georges se arregalaram de horror, "
"e o homem deu outro brincalhão encolher de ombros."

#: scenario7:scenario7_89FCADE7_D03C_44B4_B9EF_0C5B1D796B37
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 407e1c149ce759eef6a43d69726a38c737fdf4c32e24a37d1e2cccdbf5674105
#. default-sha256: 31ebd697a2e098d07ffdc8f6a04d3bb33d873e62d3ed315c744644e65b2c42cc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89FCADE7_D03C_44B4_B9EF_0C5B1D796B37"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was half a second away from throwing a barrage of insults, but I bit my tongue and stomped "
"off instead."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu estava a meio segundo de lançar uma enxurrada de insultos, mas ao invés disso mordi a "
"língua e saí batendo os pés no chão."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FC99BFE_F6FB_4B24_8258_E8925D85909E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1fb73ad0341eb7da684a9ff7325ecd2b2ef715abb4cca201b0c61a2e89f5ca95
#. default-sha256: 3b47b2e9e8e4f12ab9a22148cf58439bffd1feeabd7c0b8396e6741bf2d1b4e6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FC99BFE_F6FB_4B24_8258_E8925D85909E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had spent all that time convincing myself I couldn’t humiliate my brothers, but now, I "
"wouldn’t hear a word of it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Passei todo esse tempo me convencendo de que não poderia humilhar meus irmãos, mas agora não "
"ouviria uma palavra sobre isso."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A60071E_1925_4AB7_9C8E_54096F8FD1DB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b1255d29a747cac7ad10155fc44518893b821d2e05897921b2aff59f09e0551
#. default-sha256: 9e05f466812ffef60383c64eedf43f29aa57af6af2dad5505c7a8b9f15f148e2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A60071E_1925_4AB7_9C8E_54096F8FD1DB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say, practically swiping a glass of water off a passing waiter’s tray."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu digo, praticamente arrancando um copo de água da bandeja de um garçom que passa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FECFBDF3_A55A_4ADD_915D_B07164DC5E8C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc67aad831a1f55b2e76a160bcdb47d4a5ba313970b84d380a9ecc2e53db78df
#. default-sha256: f0b56a6a0ffaac11991e3474fc99e8584a59a558d64283920fcfd3bd674d03a3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FECFBDF3_A55A_4ADD_915D_B07164DC5E8C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I rubbed it with my sleeve until my skin was bright red. ⟪k:1⟫I wanted to feel something "
"else—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫anything else—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫even pain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Então esfreguei com a manga até minha pele ficar vermelha. ⟪k:1⟫Eu queria sentir outra coisa—"
"⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫qualquer outra coisa—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫até mesmo dor."

#: scenario7:scenario7_840FE672_9342_4BE1_B72F_036C961B64E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb810b0f4a1f9abc043d502d602e2d3103ef951fb9332c55184532bc5c70acb4
#. default-sha256: 7c45c95e1ee414d9b0d2857ff0b81abb39857843dc42eaedb6bb22e6e43b5e48
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_840FE672_9342_4BE1_B72F_036C961B64E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was angry, and I had every right to be."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu estava com raiva e tinha todo o direito de estar."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90B3244D_6CD4_441B_951E_F0577BDA53D5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 879d512a4b10ff0257a908c9dfc8b4bc839af491b44f5a5a6252482dae1918dc
#. default-sha256: a8f394d144fd4e23fc24db96b1cc965744e95e4cd679ffcb0e56e70beaa27dc4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90B3244D_6CD4_441B_951E_F0577BDA53D5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had not performed the ⟪k:1⟫proper⟪k:2⟫ greeting.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Even in jest, he had no "
"business ⟪k:5⟫actually⟪k:6⟫ putting his lips on my hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele não realizou a saudação ⟪k:1⟫adequada⟪k:2⟫.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Mesmo de brincadeira, ele não tinha "
"nada que ⟪k:5⟫colocar⟪k:6⟫ os lábios na minha mão."

#: scenario7:scenario7_698A0752_EF9B_41D6_9EE7_5F5A9FC921B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e405df47c736487f9ea1254e6e1200e03e21a6de525963c6c688b5df912fb3a4
#. default-sha256: 48f41697b22461c825c2f67ac00db3078091b23a05c42741f58ec0ffc02c435d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_698A0752_EF9B_41D6_9EE7_5F5A9FC921B1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_87EC99C0_B5CC_4789_AC25_1ED76DE8EE20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d74edd80b0aa0a24a2d577bba0d8903415c71c3897495dd6d173763fffaa06b4
#. default-sha256: 9799d4857a32b5fc0f51d414e346036c39737dbc3f73c3fa9755c1e5d56df734
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_87EC99C0_B5CC_4789_AC25_1ED76DE8EE20"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Was I angry that he had been disrespectful?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Estava eu com raiva por ele ter sido desrespeitoso?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_13D0B143_FC01_4D28_9257_7C5A908C7677
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 089a98b7bc57dcb4709b89a745e1811438f4a0829706964e0e967f9660847d32
#. default-sha256: f0f04c711f011a8a9874adb15a2c6bd6b568ea1a0eb6f41a83310b961977028e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_13D0B143_FC01_4D28_9257_7C5A908C7677"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_31BF33E2_D49F_45A8_A17E_7D56B1A59EDC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 637f3360ab87496971bc86d8c0c20f84ce8f9d1592a228e352875a14c45dd4f9
#. default-sha256: b72b71955a43d3cb456dcfbd60970cd8fc321a647cfa0c42e13946d667a7e85a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_31BF33E2_D49F_45A8_A17E_7D56B1A59EDC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫At the sound of his voice, I—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫couldn’t turn back."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ao som de sua voz, eu—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫não consegui me virar."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FBCB4019_C1E7_48D3_9B6E_78CE22099E33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ce5fe9ae573ebcdaddbbfff3e3fb1bbecfaa5e1442c91e4489232fc956727b7
#. default-sha256: eb1b42aed700547e8a5f1289bb35e2c48ebf1068dc8d280797ea5e776f673bad
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FBCB4019_C1E7_48D3_9B6E_78CE22099E33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What the hell are you doing?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Que diabos está fazendo?!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_995A4CD0_08D4_48CE_9960_87C12920C761
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af4de45259d4d9f4c6a528f9c84e7bf3ee35e7acaf092d5eb3f1816dfa55be26
#. default-sha256: 53c2d4808881b1adab608c27ba0f0229575f9b7ead976339590ef9fb91dbb20a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_995A4CD0_08D4_48CE_9960_87C12920C761"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I tried a second time to get away from him, and that was when reality sunk in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tentei uma segunda vez me afastar dele, e foi aí que a realidade caiu."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6DEC0842_64FA_4D3B_B79D_8B67D9518F68
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4daf08f6b0fd69ce33299376a13d7970360ca9d885731b3990ff52df9bd117c6
#. default-sha256: e90cb94320d5b78e34eaa1bf702bc9e1ea1d00b0fffb070029de8f52279d4bc6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6DEC0842_64FA_4D3B_B79D_8B67D9518F68"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’ve got a tongue like a boy, milady.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I know some people’re fond o’ that "
"these days.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Can’t say I mind, m’self."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você tem uma língua de menino, senhorita.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mas eu sei que algumas pessoas gostam "
"disso hoje em dia.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Eu mesmo, não posso dizer que me importe."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E87CAB54_D147_4DD3_B847_9EE7FF0445A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 411cd2860e7eec834a6e2e56c35101842f257a8eec8406241fac47a1ba3ea173
#. default-sha256: 60efa2c1c8674afb8ea7ae26f95dd3c7e2c7ebf44c7a2742c4d9dc9f942563f8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E87CAB54_D147_4DD3_B847_9EE7FF0445A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why did I have to get stuck with this body?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Por que eu tive que ficar presa a esse corpo?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BB334368_EA29_49F2_BBE4_C5C688AFB3B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38d067ef71df84e1562242907eff9b37bbc06bacc2da074121c8cc0745354c3c
#. default-sha256: 8dc905fe8a361454f5bf445cae02e6661505542a6058c3d8287c1d796142d50a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BB334368_EA29_49F2_BBE4_C5C688AFB3B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, just so we’re clear, I’m not going to hurt you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m no monster—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"promise you that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agora, só para deixar claro, não vou machucar você.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu não sou nenhum monstro—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫te prometo isso."

#: scenario7:scenario7_29DFBE46_F500_4AC9_810B_EB3F12314404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbd37d31af6c3f9d01ed2b46de1f5a089677da96120d344be3fad60d213e365a
#. default-sha256: a78b9b9424358bc10e200e39cec84cd916078cb1e2956d92c73f31dba0e4373d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_29DFBE46_F500_4AC9_810B_EB3F12314404"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Then why are you holding me against the wall?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então por que você está me segurando contra a parede?!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_272A67D3_F4A5_4706_89C4_A55D0E0C478E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c67f989be0237805523afc70ee58691277e40249846d36367583fe5a73f995a
#. default-sha256: a03c88308fa34e12e6f14ca1003e79b75eacd03e8a379881ff7ef22abe3e070e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_272A67D3_F4A5_4706_89C4_A55D0E0C478E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if I do that, you’ll run away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And it’s my personal rule to never let go of "
"anything I like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas se eu fizer isso, você fugirá.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E é minha regra pessoal nunca abrir mão de nada "
"que eu goste."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1B719745_4C01_42EC_881F_865A27C78D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a2ca51ceca023b5022edf9b6af89d16b4dc98dc4674d14ab2374c7eb59c295d
#. default-sha256: 0b9c3073ccabd9dd4519f9c72d23f8c8afe4b46900216d5f5406a7e1270f015e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1B719745_4C01_42EC_881F_865A27C78D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your brother says you can’t go outside, so if I set you loose now,⟪k:1⟫I might never get a "
"chance to catch you again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seu irmão diz que você não pode sair, então se eu te soltar agora,⟪k:1⟫talvez eu nunca tenha "
"a chance de te pegar de novo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B1EBFCD3_AEE4_47BA_A33C_20B008897DA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: be8ae2ab74154fa68af0d7a50e404bf2e2b6e885421c4c11bb5b1bf94eb7730f
#. default-sha256: 42c032e3b0e080950c0485ecb8345fa9dcd57198a05f495961654b19857a70b9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B1EBFCD3_AEE4_47BA_A33C_20B008897DA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Besides, I’m a minstrel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Spend some time with me, and I’ll write you all the songs "
"you could possibly want."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Além disso, sou um menestrel.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Passe algum tempo comigo e eu escreverei todas as "
"músicas que você poderia desejar."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D247F410_D567_41F1_90BE_AC300EED08FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3994ab101acff8fcc30b79682931bd458e8f7e98cab0d178b7d01bfabb4835b0
#. default-sha256: 9fcd0ed2ae86bb59b3c719cd53dc4abdc2fb6f85beabdf400ef7faf40dd911ad
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D247F410_D567_41F1_90BE_AC300EED08FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫With a muse like that, I could write the most incredible songs you’ve ever heard."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Com uma musa dessas eu poderia escrever as músicas mais incríveis que você já ouviu."

#: scenario7:scenario7_48CDC704_7A4F_428A_B1BC_99C9404AF688
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfbb6524ef537bebd611d4fd4e48878a923ffd7cb9014eb80e9fcc74151eaef2
#. default-sha256: 2c12ed4eee6e086ce23bf53f989f613b10354e1e18ce235607c80739f4467be0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_48CDC704_7A4F_428A_B1BC_99C9404AF688"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Huh... ⟪k:1⟫That’s odd.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That one’s never failed me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Huh... ⟪k:1⟫Estranho.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Essa nunca me falhou."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5165BADF_6DF9_4E4E_9596_C0098CB4B5AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bca7d58d04d7c08c7b55c3639b6e7f9b550a2e55f0af86b84a650b922ef2506c
#. default-sha256: 7a95bdef939ec9e62dee2734b48b3f759d97aa3c7419a65148076197e53db4ec
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5165BADF_6DF9_4E4E_9596_C0098CB4B5AD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man brought his face in just inches from mine and peered into my eyes. ⟪k:1⟫I could feel "
"his hot, wine-stenched breath against my cheeks."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O homem aproximou seu rosto a poucos centímetros do meu e olhou nos meus olhos. ⟪k:1⟫Eu "
"podia sentir seu hálito quente e fedorento de vinho contra minhas bochechas."

#: scenario7:scenario7_42D9CCE6_AF58_4433_9E36_AD707DB80A34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 673a45a5282ddafe8d573efffe207bee6a0008ce89b87f4afb52b9ff9976a852
#. default-sha256: 1df4574416836c98ff6d9f3bc74faa387ada17ba3fbe01bc8973541ad0a06533
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_42D9CCE6_AF58_4433_9E36_AD707DB80A34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You will be soon enough, darling.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’ve simply never known a man’s touch."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você estará em breve, querida.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você simplesmente nunca conheceu o toque de um homem."

#: scenario7:scenario7_458378D7_E0CD_4771_BA3E_28BD945FECB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
